Today is Sunday.
It is morning time.
My street is very quiet.
I go to the corner shop.
There is a man in the shop.
I say, "Hello, bhaiya."
He says, "Hello, madam."
There are many sweets in the shop.
They are very colorful.
I say, "Bhaiya, I want one box."
He gives me one box.
There are red and yellow sweets in the box.
I give two hundred rupees.
My family is in Mexico.
Today is my video call.
This box is for my family.
I take the box of sweets.
I come back home.
